	'King Rance, General Arlcoate'
	R
	'is here.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_044f3:
	ZH 1:
	'Mm, aah... She came?'
	R
	'Let her in.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_0452b:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris led Arlcoate in.'
	R
	'She was as nervous as always.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_045c5:
	!VAR0516 : 77!
	\L_045b7:
	\L_04563:
	ZH 1:
	'Um... I’ll be a lieutenant'
	R
	'general in your Green Army'
	R
	'from today on... I-I hope we'
	R
	'work well together...'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_044f3:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah, for sure.'
	R
	'Do your best for me.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_04563:
	ZH 1:
	'But... Um, Your Majesty, it...'
	R
	'It doesn’t matter how hard I'
	R
	'try...'
	\L_04618:
	ZH 1:
	'It was a mistake to make me a'
	R
	'general...'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_044f3:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh, you’ll be fine.'
	R
	'You’re a genius.'
	R
	'Just don’t worry about it and'
	R
	'show off your talent.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_04563:
	ZH 1:
	'But I’m just a coward...'
	R
	'I only win because I’m afraid'
	R
	'to lose... I’m not a genius...'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_044f3:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey, stop your pointless'
	R
	'babbling and just do your best.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_04563:
	ZH 1:
	'Um, if I fail, will I be'
	R
	'executed...?'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_044f3:
	ZH 1:
	'NO.'
	R
	'Stop being worried for no'
	R
	'reason. I’ll execute you for'
	R
	'not doing your best.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_04563:
	ZH 1:
	'...Hii...'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_0452b:
	ZH 1:
	'Arlcoate gasped. She seemed to'
	R
	'be seriously frightened.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_044f3:
	ZH 1:
	'Daaaaaaaaaaaaaah, okay, get'
	R
	'over here. I’ll give you this'
	R
	'personally, so do your best.'
	R
	'Okay?'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_0452b:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance grabbed Arlcoate’s hand'
	R
	'and gave her the shell with a'
	R
	'hole in it.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_04563:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... It’s beautiful.'
	R
	'...Your Majesty... I’ll do'
	R
	'what I can...'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_044f3:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm.'
	R
	'That’s all you need to do.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_0452b:
	ZH 1:
	'Arlcoate bowed and walked away.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_045c5:
	!VAR0516 : 5!
	\L_045b7:
	\L_04563:
	ZH 1:
	'This is so unfair, Darling...'
	R
	'Give me a shell, too.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_044f3:
	ZH 1:
	'No.'
	R
	'I only gave her that one'
	R
	'because there was a hole in it.'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
	\L_04563:
	ZH 1:
	'Uuu... No fair...'
	\L_04618:
	\L_0460b:
